?><!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SkyNoc API</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:25px 16px;line-height:1.6;color:#0f172a;background:#f8fafc}main{background:#fff;padding:28px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px #0f172a0a}code,pre{background:#f1f5f9;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:7px}pre{padding:15px;overflow:auto}.endpoint{border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:15px;margin:12px 0}@media(max-width:600px){main{padding:20px}h1{font-size:28px}}a{color:#2563eb}</style></head><body><main><h1>SkyNoc API v1</h1><p>Authentication: <code>Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY</code></p><p>API keys are reseller-specific and never expose upstream provider credentials.</p><h2>Scopes</h2><ul><li><code>licenses:read</code> — list/view your licenses</li><li><code>reissue:create</code> — create reissue requests</li><li><code>reissue:read</code> — read your reissue requests</li><li><code>packages:read</code> — list active license packages</li><li><code>orders:create</code> — purchase a package using your wallet</li><li><code>orders:read</code> — read your order history</li></ul><h2>Endpoints</h2><div class="endpoint"><b>GET /api/v1/packages</b><p>Returns active packages and their reseller prices.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>POST /api/v1/orders</b><p>Creates a package order and deducts the package price from the reseller wallet.</p><pre>{ "package_id": 1, "domain": "billing.example.com" }</pre><p>The order remains pending until SkyNoc fulfills it with an available license.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>GET /api/v1/orders</b><p>Returns your package order history.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>GET /api/v1/licenses</b><p>Returns only licenses assigned to the authenticated reseller.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>GET /api/v1/licenses/{id}</b><p>Returns one owned license and its history.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>GET /api/v1/reissues</b><p>Returns your reissue request history.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><b>POST /api/v1/licenses/{id}/reissue</b><p>JSON body:</p><pre>{ "new_domain": "new.example.com", "reason": "Server migration" }</pre><p>Creates a pending request for staff review.</p></div><h2>Limits</h2><p>Wallet purchases require an active reseller account and sufficient balance. New reseller accounts require a minimum $15 activation deposit; the approved deposit is credited to the reseller wallet. The $15 is not a separate non-refundable activation fee.</p><p>60 requests per minute per API key. A <code>429</code> response includes <code>Retry-After</code>.</p></main></body></html>